text = "You play as a slow loris, an endangered animal species in Asia. Humans are trying to burn down the area you live in to make room for new data centers. There's a time limit because everything behind you starts catching fire. You can see the boundary marked by the red line. At the end, there's a small mini-boss you have to defeat to make it through.

Have fun!

P.S. I made all the sprites myself, which is why everything looks like shit."

